@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@token = replace-with-access-token
@subscriptionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Offers, own subscriptions and balance (authority host, not business API host)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/resource-subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Prepare or resume approval; server owns all prices and PayPal plan identifiers
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/resource-subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"pack":"Discovery"}

### Reconcile verified payments after returning from PayPal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/resource-subscriptions/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel own subscription; unknown or foreign identifiers return 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/resource-subscriptions/{{subscriptionId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Browser landing page (anonymous, never grants credit)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/resource-subscriptions/return

### Invalid pack: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/resource-subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"pack":"Unknown"}
